@startuml DocumentLifecycle
title Document Lifecycle - State Diagram

[*] --> Draft : Create document

Draft --> Processing : Submit for processing
Processing --> Indexed : Indexing complete
Processing --> OCRPending : Image-based document

OCRPending --> OCRProcessing : Start OCR
OCRProcessing --> Indexed : OCR complete

Indexed --> Active : Open / View
Active --> Annotated : Add annotation
Annotated --> Active : Remove annotation

Active --> Archived : Archive document
Archived --> Active : Restore document

Active --> Deleted : Delete document
Archived --> Deleted : Delete document
Deleted --> [*] : Purge

Indexed --> Shared : Share document
Shared --> Indexed : Revoke sharing

@enduml
